  <section id="vosstanovlenie">
    <h2>Recovery</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Rehabilitation and exercise therapy — a programme chosen according to the symptoms before surgery.</li>
      <li>During recovery — limited physical activity, no driving and no alcohol.</li>
      <li>Follow-up MRI on schedule — even after complete removal.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

